    "Reason : 1 - Due to the inclusion of primary living facilities, the proposal would fail to relate incidentally or subordinately to the main dwelling and would be out of keeping with the character of the local area, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, SC7 and SC1 as well as the council's design guidance.",
    "Reason : 2 - The self-contained residential use of the outbuilding would create an unneighbourly relationship, especially given the close proximity to the rear elevations of neighbouring properties. The proposal would introduce increased levels of activity and different patterns of use at the foot of the amenity area which would affect the quiet enjoyment of the rear garden space enjoyed by neighbouring occupiers at present contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and SC7 as well as the council's design guidance."
